manage the shared local router

Usage:
  treerig router [flags]
  treerig router [command]

Available Commands:
  up          start the shared router and wait until it is healthy
  status      report whether the shared router is running as expected
  down        stop the shared router; worktree services keep running but are no
              longer routed

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for router

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number

Use "treerig router [command] --help" for more information about a command.
